  "prefLabel": "Ath 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 103.01 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 328-F:4, IV the board shall consist of 3 currently and fully licensed athletic trainers who have actively engaged in the practice of athletic training in this state for at least 3 years, one physician educated in the current practice of sports medicine, and one public member.\n\nSource. #8345, eff 5-7-05; ss by #12946, eff 12-20-19 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ath 100); ss by #14373, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ath100-500.html"
